        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Source-Hugging Edge Lanes\n\n**Candidate route:** handle → normal exit → source shoulder → lane merge → corridor → target approach.\n\nPorts and handles behave normally. The graph View derives routing geometry. The authored edge remains one typed relationship with one identity."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "ownsContent": true,
          "surfaceDelegation": true
